# FACTORY (the author, 2026-10-05): `@: h f(a)` receives a factory's result; this row wrote `h: f a` until then.
# Item 738 slice 2: a captured Structure's Structure field passed on (`probe(loc\box)`) -- slice 1 copies value
# fields only.  box is Model's own nested Structure (K03 NS-ROLES-2: `Inner: box` is Inner's call now).
Inner:
    int: c 5
end: Inner
Model:
    int: other 5
    box:
        int: c 5
    int: count 0
    int: value 0
end: Model

fn: probe (Inner: q) int
    return: q\c

fn: makeReader (int: n) fn: (int: x) int
    loc: merge: Model
    loc\value: n
    fn: read (int: x) int
        return: probe(loc\box) + x
    return: read

@: r40 makeReader(40)
int: a (r40: 2)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
